N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=common}}'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife which can be claimed by purchasing the 2nd tier of the battlepass in the [[Halloween Event 2024]], it costs 800 [[Candies (2024)|candies]] {{Currency|Candies2024|25px}}.

== Appearance ==
It has a yellow blade from the tip to the middle which fades into a dark golden brown, it has candy corns stuck onto the knife’s blade, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Candy Corn Gun (2024)|matching gun]] under the same name.

